      "local": {
        "id": "approvals_meaningful",
        "mode": "structure",
        "comment": null,
        "description": "A recorded approve expresses a judgement the approver took on based solely on the local view, and does not degenerate into formal ritual",
        "evidence": null,
        "children": {
          "comment": null,
          "entries": [
            {
              "id": "description_is_contract",
              "comment": null,
              "description": "In a living argument, descriptions are maintained as contract sentences whose truth can be judged without reading the substructure"
            },
            {
              "id": "labels_cover_reality",
              "comment": null,
              "description": "The three labels approve / decline / cannot-take-responsibility express, without excess or gaps, the judgement states an approver can take:\n\n- **approve**: take it on (optionally reserved with an approver-side `until:<phase>`)\n- **decline**: refuse; a veto, with a reason comment required\n- **cannot-take-responsibility**: cannot take this on personally; a delegate may be named"
            },
            {
              "id": "policy_is_reviewable",
              "comment": null,
              "description": "Which targets need how many approvals from whom is defined by policy text in the repository, and changes to approval criteria go through PR review"
            },
            {
              "id": "queue_minimizes_friction",
              "comment": null,
              "description": "An approver is presented with only the unapproved or stale local views the policy demands of them, together with a diff against the local view they last approved"
            },
            {
              "id": "browser_review_sound",
              "comment": null,
              "description": "A decision recorded from the browser is the judgement `inka review` would have recorded: taken on the whole local view, on the content that was on screen, by the approver the server was started as"
            }
          ]
        },
        "deadline": null
      }
    },
